<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Support Ticket Confirmation</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f4f4;">
<table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" bgcolor="#f4f4f4" style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f4f4;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">
<tr><td align="center">
<table width="920" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" bgcolor="#ffffff" style="max-width:920px;">

<tr><td height="12" bgcolor="#002b8f"></td></tr>

<tr><td align="center" style="padding:30px 20px;background:#ffffff;">
<img src="https://myfrequentrewards.com/images/logo/mfr-logo.png" alt="MyFrequentRewards" width="520" style="display:block;max-width:100%;" />
</td></tr>

<tr><td height="1" bgcolor="#fe7e00"></td></tr>

<tr><td style="padding:35px 60px 15px;">
<p style="margin:0 0 25px;font-size:28px;color:#0d2372;font-weight:bold;">Hi {{user.name}},</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:38px;color:#14245d;">Thank you for reaching out to MyFrequent<span style="color:#fe7e00;">Rewards</span>. We have received your support request and your ticket has been successfully created.</p>
</td></tr>

<tr><td style="padding:30px 55px;">

<table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="border:1px solid #d7e4ff;border-radius:12px;background:#f8fbff;">

<tr><td align="center" width="220" style="padding:30px;">
<img src="https://frequentresearch.com/mailer/mail-icons/mfr/mail.png" width="150" alt="Support Ticket" style="display:block;" />
</td>

<td style="padding:35px 35px 35px 0;">
<h2 style="margin:0 0 15px;color:#0d2372;font-size:30px;">Support Ticket Created</h2>
<p style="margin:0 0 25px;color:#17285f;font-size:20px;line-height:34px;">Our support team is currently reviewing your request and will get back to you within 24 to 48 hours with an update.</p>

<table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
<tr>
<td style="background:#fe7e00;color:#ffffff;padding:12px 22px;border-radius:8px;font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;">Ticket ID: {{data.ticketNo}}</td>
</tr>
</table>

</td></tr>
</table>

</td></tr>

<tr><td style="padding:0 55px 35px;">

<table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="background:#fef8f2;border:1px solid #f0d7b4;border-radius:10px;">
<tr>

<td width="120" align="center" style="padding:25px;">
<img src="https://frequentresearch.com/mailer/mail-icons/mfr/shield.png" width="85" alt="Information" style="display:block;" />
</td>

<td style="padding:25px 25px 25px 0;">
<h3 style="margin:0 0 10px;color:#0d2372;font-size:22px;">Need to Add More Information?</h3>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:30px;color:#22305f;">Please do not reply to this email. To add more details or respond to your support request, please use the Support Ticket system.</p>
</td>

</tr>
</table>

</td></tr>

<tr><td style="padding:0 55px 35px;">
<p style="margin:0;font-size:20px;line-height:34px;color:#14245d;">Thank you for your patience and cooperation. We appreciate you reaching out to us and will work to resolve your request as soon as possible.</p>
</td></tr>
        {% include "mailer/footer.liquid" %}
</table>
</td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
